### EN

**truth — было:** {P1} and {P2}, if you both wish, just between yourselves: Would you rather keep a little souvenir unexplained or tell why it matters?

**truth — стало:** {P1} and {P2}, if you both wish, each answer in private chat: would you rather keep a little souvenir unexplained or tell why it matters?

**dare — было:** {P1} and {P2}, if you both wish, just between yourselves: Invent an ordinary museum label and a personal label just for your pair for a souvenir. No real object is needed.

**dare — стало:** {P1} and {P2}, if you both wish, invent a museum label and a wholly fictional personal label for a souvenir in private chat. No shared secret is needed; you may skip either part.


