**proposal — было:** {P1}, if you both wish, suggest to {P2} that you build a personal imaginary scene called “the first two minutes of a visit”, adding one little detail that would help each feel at ease.

**proposal — стало:** {P1}, invite {P2} to build a wholly fictional “first two minutes of a visit” in private chat. Each adds a detail helping a character feel at ease. No personal experience is needed.

**responder — было:** “Yes, but…” — {P2} may invent a condition or say no. {P1} may decline too; begin only when both agree. Either may stop without giving a reason.

